Wrote coder-2.json with one row for Soliday / data-centers. Coded as V6 = rung 4 (`chair-shaped`), resting on both the IGA bill-details page (`own-act`/`record`/`author`, actor_quote from the "Authored by" line) and the enrolled act text (`record`/`author`, provision_quote from the 90-day commission deadline clause), both `in-term`. Reasoning ties the bill's expedited commission-approval process and forecasting/cost-disclosure/public-comment requirements to rung 4's text, and distinguishes it from rung 5 (too much regulatory structure to be "minimal barriers") and rung 3 (no community-benefit-requirement clause).
